# Crypt Feaster (CR 207.2c, 603.4, 508.1m): "Threshold — Whenever this creature attacks, if there are seven or more cards in your
# graveyard, this creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn." The Wheel of Fortune (cast off Black Lotus) leaves five cards in
# Bot1's graveyard (Black Lotus, three Islands, the Wheel). On turn 5 the 3/4 attacks as a 3/4 (Bot2 at 17); on turn 7 Faithless
# Looting (two Islands drawn, both discarded, the spell itself) makes eight and it attacks as a 5/4 (Bot2 at 12).

